### Panduan Pengujian (Bisa dijalankan di ekstensi VS Code 'REST Client' atau Postman)
### Pastikan server PHP sudah menyala di localhost:8003

### ==========================================
### 1. Uji Login untuk mendapatkan JWT Token
### ==========================================
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8003/api/index.php/auth?action=login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "rkz123"
}

### ==========================================
### 2. Uji Endpoint GET Paket (Memerlukan Token)
### ==========================================
### Copy token dari hasil login di atas, lalu letakkan setelah kata Bearer di bawah ini:
GET http://localhost:8003/api/index.php/paket
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer MASUKKAN_TOKEN_ANDA_DISINI

### ==========================================
### 3. Uji Endpoint Cek Kapasitas Aktif Pasien
### ==========================================
GET http://localhost:8003/api/index.php/pasien?action=kapasitas_aktif&no_erm=ERM001
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer MASUKKAN_TOKEN_ANDA_DISINI

### ==========================================
### 4. Uji Penggunaan Sesi 
### ==========================================
POST http://localhost:8003/api/index.php/pasien?action=gunakan_sesi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer MASUKKAN_TOKEN_ANDA_DISINI

{
    "id_kapasitas": 1,
    "sisa_saat_ini": 10,
    "id_tindakan": 1,
    "no_erm": "ERM001",
    "no_register_kunjungan": "REG2026-001",
    "tanggal_paket": "2026-08-06 10:00:00",
    "sesi_ke": 1
}
